<title>JAPAN: Toa Steel to post profit from asset sales.</title>
<headline>Toa Steel to post profit from asset sales.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toa Steel Co Ltd said on Friday that it would post 23.58 billion yen profit from asset sales in the year starting in April 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
